# Put the interfaces in their zones (this changes traffic at once):
#   zone LAN / interface X0
#   zone WAN / interface X1
#   zone WAN / interface X4
#   zone DMZ / interface X2
#   zone FWS_Servers / interface X3
#   zone FWS_VPN: no interface is known
# Written inactive:
#   Mail server pings the LAN: references 'Echo Object': ICMP type and code of a service object: how the export stores them is not known
#   Administrators to the DMZ: source user match Admins is not converted
#   Updates in working hours: schedule 'Work Hours' is not converted; the rule would apply at all times; host name object Update Site: the form of an address object of a host name is not in the documentation FWShift could read
